--- !u!114 &295765274
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 295765273}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 81cb5cd6eac315c4d81f7fb11e82518f, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::CutsceneManager
  steps:
  - sceneObject: {fileID: 551315063}
    textDisplay: {fileID: 815569927}
    dialogueText: "They say that when you\u2019re scared, your mind creates a star
      to follow."
    lingerTime: 2
    fadeDuration: 1
    triggerHospitalBips: 0
  - sceneObject: {fileID: 178098427}
    textDisplay: {fileID: 815569927}
    dialogueText: Something bright to look at so you don't have to see the cracks.
    lingerTime: 2
    fadeDuration: 1
    triggerHospitalBips: 0
  - sceneObject: {fileID: 1185441657}
    textDisplay: {fileID: 815569927}
    dialogueText: But the star was never real. It was just a distraction from the
      fact that I wasn't getting better.
    lingerTime: 2
    fadeDuration: 2
    triggerHospitalBips: 1
  - sceneObject: {fileID: 223513233}
    textDisplay: {fileID: 815569927}
    dialogueText: I built all these rooms just to have somewhere to run. But you
      can't outrun your own failing body.
    lingerTime: 2
    fadeDuration: 1
    triggerHospitalBips: 1
  - sceneObject: {fileID: 969107199}
    textDisplay: {fileID: 815569927}
    dialogueText: You can't hide from the panic when it lives inside your own chest.
      This place was never a place to heal.
    lingerTime: 2
    fadeDuration: 2
    triggerHospitalBips: 1
  - sceneObject: {fileID: 1231940260}
    textDisplay: {fileID: 815569927}
    dialogueText: 
    lingerTime: 10
    fadeDuration: 2
    triggerHospitalBips: 0
  fadePanel: {fileID: 1860414113}
  hospitalBips: {fileID: 1017763992}
  typingAudioSource: {fileID: 1489888223}
  typingKeySound: {fileID: 8300000, guid: c6882d3bd1673374d8a910c8c9a9f84a, type: 3}
  typingSpeed: 0.05
